Tell the context agent when to load the system-spec-kit skill and which file is its entry point.

Files (exactly two, same change in each):
1. .skilled/agents/context.md
2. .claude/agents/context.md

Change A. Under `## 2. ROUTING SCAN` one line reads exactly:
Read `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/data/trigger-index.json` directly.
Leave that line as it is. Directly after it, add this one new line (no blank line between):
Load the system-spec-kit skill when a continuity question goes beyond these two paths: its entry file is `SKILL.md`, wherever the runtime installed the skill (in this repository: `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/SKILL.md`).

Verification (run all, paste the output in the handback):
